# The sdist is what the wheel is built from, not a way to run the suite.
# setuptools' default file set took tests/test_*.py but none of the helpers
# they import (source_path, tiers, ...), nor fixtures/ or scripts/, so none of
# the 51 modules it shipped could be imported from an unpacked sdist (measured),
# and they were half its size. The suite runs from a clone.
# scripts/release_check.py dist refuses an sdist that carries tests/ again.
prune tests
